# Reviews & Ratings

This guide explains how buyers can review and rate products purchased on the Codexeron Marketplace.

Reviews help buyers make informed decisions and help sellers improve their products.

---

# Overview

Reviews provide feedback about:

- Product quality
- Functionality
- Documentation
- Support experience
- Overall satisfaction

A fair review system helps maintain marketplace trust.

---

# Eligibility to Review

Only eligible buyers may submit reviews.

A buyer may review a product after:

- Completing a valid purchase.
- Accessing the purchased product.
- Having sufficient experience with the product.

---

# Rating System

Products may be rated using a star-based system.

Example:

```
★★★★★ Excellent
★★★★☆ Good
★★★☆☆ Average
★★☆☆☆ Poor
★☆☆☆☆ Very Poor
```

Ratings should reflect the actual product experience.

---

# Writing a Review

A useful review should include:

- Product experience
- Features that worked well
- Possible improvements
- Installation experience
- Documentation quality

Reviews should be clear, respectful, and based on actual usage.

---

# Review Guidelines

Reviews must:

- Be honest.
- Be related to the purchased product.
- Avoid personal attacks.
- Avoid misleading information.
- Respect marketplace rules.

---

# Prohibited Review Content

Reviews should not contain:

- Spam
- Advertising
- Offensive language
- False claims
- Personal information
- Content unrelated to the product

Reviews that violate guidelines may be removed.

---

# Seller Responses

When available, sellers may respond to customer reviews.

Professional responses help:

- Clarify issues.
- Provide support information.
- Build customer trust.

---

# Review Moderation

Codexeron may review submitted content to maintain marketplace quality.

Actions may include:

- Removing inappropriate reviews.
- Requesting additional information.
- Restricting abusive activity.

---

# Improving Products Through Feedback

Sellers can use reviews to:

- Fix problems.
- Improve documentation.
- Add requested features.
- Improve customer experience.

Constructive feedback helps improve the marketplace.

---

# Best Practices

For buyers:

- Test products before reviewing.
- Provide detailed feedback.
- Be fair and objective.

For sellers:

- Respond professionally.
- Learn from feedback.
- Improve products continuously.

